{"id":"vod_bf_15965","vodId":"15965","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"机动战士高达 铁血的奥尔芬斯第一季","name_cn":"机动战士高达 铁血的奥尔芬斯第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-17/6d198a6f0c02cd0b2526445123dc8254.jpg"},"summary":"曾经有一场被称作“厄祭战”的大型战争。那场战争终结后过了大约300年。　　地球圈失去了至今为止的统治机构，在新的支配体系下，新世界被构筑起来。一时的和平到来，与此同时，远离地球的火星圈燃起了新战争的火种。　　主人公——少年三日月·奥古斯，从所属的民间警备公司克律塞安保公司（下称CGS）那里，接受了打算让在地球势力统治下的火星都市独立的少女库德莉亚·蓝那·伯恩斯坦的护卫任务。但，CGS受到摘取反叛之芽的武力组织加拉尔霍恩的袭击，于是在把三日月这些孩子当做诱饵后撤退了。少年们的领袖，奥尔加·伊兹卡认为这是个机会，并决定对虐待自己的大人们掀起反旗。被奥尔加托付击退加拉尔霍恩的三日月，利用被当做CGS动力炉来使用的“厄祭战”时代的机动战士——高达·巴巴托斯，向敌军发起挑战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:17:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodatiexuedeaoerfensidiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodatiexuedeaoerfensidiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodatiexuedeaoerfensidiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodatiexuedeaoerfensidiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodatiexuedeaoerfensidiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodatiexuedeaoerfensidiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodatiexuedeaoerfensidiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodatiexuedeaoerfensidiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodatiexuedeaoerfensidiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jidongzhanshigaodatiexuedeaoerfensidiyiji/